  "application": {
    "cn": "该系列是一种大输出力、高性能的气动活塞式执行机构，分为双作用型和单动作型两种，与角行程调节阀组合使用，可用于调节和开关的场合。该系列也可用于其它回转运动的场合。缸体内壁镀硬铬抛光或喷涂特氟龙涂层，活塞杆镀硬铬抛光，有很好的抗磨性；所有滑动部件之间均配有无油润滑轴承和导向环以降低摩擦系数，延长使用寿命。该系列气缸执行机构的 U 型曲线特性输出扭矩更适用于大口径球阀、蝶阀的开关和调节，也可用于其他 90° 回转场合。",
    "en": "This Series provides double-acting and spring return preu-matic cylinder actuators characterized by large output and high-performance. Combined with rotary stem motion type control valves, the actuators of this Series are suited for modulating and on-off services. Uses with other rotary motion devices are also good. The inner wall of the cylinder is plated with hard lead polishing or Teflon coating. And the piston rod is plated with hard fault polishing. So that they have good abrasion resistance. All sliding parts are equipped with non oil lubricated bearings and the guide to reduce the friction coefficient and extend the service life. The series of pneumatic actuator is more applicable to switch large caliber ball valve and butterfly wide and adjustment with U type characteristic curve. It can also be used for other 90° rotary occasions."
  },
